---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Writing — Async Forest Advisory"
  description="Notes on technical assurance, AI in production, and trust in autonomous systems, by Dr Henry Franks."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Writing</span>
      <h1>Notes on assurance, AI in production, and trust</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Occasional, practical pieces: what actually goes wrong in AI-heavy
        codebases, how to read a due-diligence report, and what "responsible
        AI" means when you have to ship on Friday.
      </p>

      <div class="card empty">
        <span class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z" />
            <path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4" />
            <path d="M10 9H8" />
            <path d="M16 13H8" />
            <path d="M16 17H8" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <h2 class="empty__title">Nothing published here yet</h2>
        <p class="empty__body">
          The first pieces are being written now. Until they land, the same
          thinking shows up in my
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/henryfranks/">LinkedIn posts</a>
          — or <a href="/contact/">send me your email</a> and I'll let you know
          when the first note is up. No list, no funnel; just a one-line email
          from me.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .empty {
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
    padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-8);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .empty__icon {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface-warm-2);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .empty__title { font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .empty__body {
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }
</style>
